---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '../config';
const giscus = siteConfig.giscus;
---
<BaseLayout title="留言板" description="青野山房留言板：道友路过，不妨留下一言半语。">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="page-head">
      <h1 class="page-title">留言板</h1>
      <p class="page-desc">山房门前设一青石，道友路过，不妨留下一言半语。散人巡山时自会一一拜读。</p>
    </header>

    {giscus ? (
      <div class="giscus-wrap">
        <script src="https://giscus.app/client.js"
          data-repo={giscus.repo}
          data-repo-id={giscus.repoId}
          data-category={giscus.category}
          data-category-id={giscus.categoryId}
          data-mapping={giscus.mapping ?? 'pathname'}
          data-strict="0"
          data-reactions-enabled="1"
          data-emit-metadata="0"
          data-input-position="top"
          data-theme="light"
          data-lang="zh-CN"
          crossorigin="anonymous"
          async></script>
      </div>
    ) : (
      <div class="guestbook-placeholder">
        <h3>留言功能待接入</h3>
        <p>青石已备，法阵未启。山房留言板基于 giscus（GitHub Discussions 驱动），待山主配好法阵阵眼即可启用。接入方法：在 <code>src/config.ts</code> 中将 <code>giscus</code> 由 <code>null</code> 改为如下配置（字段可在 giscus.app 生成），重新构建即生效：</p>
        <pre>giscus: {'{'}
  repo: '你的用户名/仓库名',
  repoId: 'R_xxxxxx',
  category: 'General',
  categoryId: 'DIC_xxxxxx',
  mapping: 'pathname',
{'}'}</pre>
        <p style="margin-top: 1rem;">在法阵开启之前，道友若有话说，可径往 <a href="/about">关于页</a> 默念三遍「青野散人」，山主自会心生感应。</p>
      </div>
    )}
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
